Z||000000||jhogans||03-29-2000||12:35 PM||||I came across in the alt.autos.kitcar newsgroup.  Final Concepts, the guys that make the Lambo kit are selling their business.<P><BR>*******************************************<BR>FOR SALE<P>Lamborghini Countach 5000S Mold, by Final Concept, Punta Gorda, Florida.<BR>The plug for building the mold is available as well  as all the interior<BR>molds. The building and trailer are also available.<P>Our mold is very well know for it exceptional design.  We have lowered the<BR>air boxes, rounded the wheel wells.  Raised the pedestals and thinned the<BR>wing, making the rear window functional.  We have also placed a slight<BR>bubble in the roof which allows for approximately 1 ¾ inch more head room<BR>and allowing an area or a third brake light.  Our rear deck is tiered for<BR>venting.  Two vents in the door areas<BR>(one for cooling the brakes).  Our design gives approximately nine inches<BR>more hip room than any other kit.  With our mold, if you have a finder<BR>bender, you can have your glass man remove the damaged part and we can make<BR>the part and it can be glassed in.<P>The interior parts for the dash board, two parts; door panels; rear door<BR>(jam area) frame, two parts to the console area.<P>The entire business is for sale. The drawings for the chassis, all of the<BR>information for wheels, hinges, lights, vents, dash boards, windshield<BR>wiper, nuts, bolts and more, available. Assistance on 3.8 and 3.8<BR>Supercharged Engines.   Will sell all or part.  If some one is interested in<BR>the entire business, I would be pleased to assist in the completion of the<BR>first car.<P>If you would care to conduct the business in the existing building it is<BR>also for sale or lease , and the owner will finance the building.  The<BR>building is 2500 sq.ft. with five large overhead doors, one parts room, one<BR>office, one sewing room with a new Mercury sewing machine, used three times.<BR>Loft for storage and crawl space for storage.  Lift (approximately 9000 lbs.<BR>capacity), air compressor.  Welder, engine hoist, engine stands, tools are<BR>also available.  Trailer designed to carry the Lamborghini is available.<BR>Cement parking lot, entirely fenced in.  Monitored security system, two<BR>bathrooms and one shower and much more. Business is currently in Punta<BR>Gorda, Florida, which is midway between Ft. Myers and Sarasota.<P>All reasonable offers considered.  Contact Patricia Rowland, 941-629-8224 or<BR>email at:  tytanic@sunline.net<P>||||reg||1
